    '"Except for the four Hours, of which each has one and the same form, all other parts of the Divine Service have several forms, namely: Vespers -- Great, Daily, and Small; and Great [Vespers], in turn, can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it; Compline -- Great and Small, and Great [Compline] can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it; Midnight Office -- Daily, Saturday, and Sunday; Matins -- Great and Small, or Daily, and Great [Matins] can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it; Liturgy -- Full: of St. John Chrysostom and of St. Basil the Great, and Incomplete, that is, of the Presanctified Gifts."',
    'Except for the four Hours, of which each has one and the same form, all other parts of the Divine Service have several forms, namely:\r\n* **Vespers**: Great, Daily, and Small; and Great [Vespers], in turn, can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it;\r\n* **Compline**: Great and Small, and Great [Compline] can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it;\r\n* **Midnight Office**: Daily, Saturday, and Sunday;\r\n* **Matins**: Great and Small, or Daily, and Great [Matins] can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it;\r\n* **Liturgy**: Full: of St. John Chrysostom and of St. Basil the Great, and Incomplete, that is, of the Presanctified Gifts.'
